<title>USA: Montgomery Ward names chairman, chief executive.</title>
<headline>Montgomery Ward names chairman, chief executive.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Montgomery Ward &amp; Co Inc said Thursday it has appointed Roger Goddu chairman and chief executive.</p>
<p>Goddu previously served as president of USA Toy Store Merchandising for Toys R Us Inc, the company said.</p>
<p>Goddu replaces Bernard Brennan, who will remain as chairman of Montgomery Ward Holding Corp, the parent of the Montgomery Ward retail operation.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
